--
N5008 [dcl.spec.auto.general]/3, [expr.prim.lambda.closure]/7: the
closure's operator() template takes `const T &' for `const auto &'.  The
closure synthesis replaced the whole decl-specifier `const auto' by the
invented parameter, dropping `const', so an rvalue argument did not bind
("found no match for symbol 'operator()'", bin53).  g++ 13 and clang++ 18
accept this program, and it fails only its WRONG assertion.
